# Rust repository .gitignore.
# /target is Cargo build output (never tracked). Cargo.lock is committed for
# binary workspaces and deployable services so builds remain reproducible.

/target
**/target/

# The per-repo doc emission (repo_skills_dir on cli_routing) — the same entry
# the publisher body carries, and the same reason it is scoped to
# `repos-*/`: one directory per repo-owned doc, never a bare `.opencode/`
# (which would hide this repo's own hand-written opencode files).
.opencode/skills/repos-*/

